<%- include('partials/head', { bodyClass: 'page--public', pageTitle }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav-public') %>

<main class="container page-shell">
  <div class="auth-layout">
    <section class="auth-visual surface">
      <span class="eyebrow">Cadastro</span>
      <h2>Abra sua conta e comece com um fluxo padronizado.</h2>
      <p>O formulario segue a politica de senha exigida pelo backend e mostra mensagens claras quando algo falha.</p>
      <div class="hero-preview">
        <div class="hero-preview__grid">
          <div class="hero-preview__mini"><strong>Senha</strong><span>Segura</span></div>
          <div class="hero-preview__mini"><strong>Email</strong><span>Unico</span></div>
          <div class="hero-preview__mini"><strong>Perfil</strong><span>Completo</span></div>
          <div class="hero-preview__mini"><strong>Fluxo</strong><span>Direto</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>Nome, sobrenome, email e senha sao obrigatorios.</li>
        <li>Senha precisa ter maiuscula, minuscula, numero e caractere especial.</li>
        <li>Erros do backend aparecem por campo e no topo do formulario.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="auth-card surface surface--strong">
      <div>
        <h1>Criar conta</h1>
        <p>Preencha seus dados para acessar o modulo financeiro completo.</p>
      </div>

      <%- include('partials/flash') %>
      <%- include('partials/error-banner', { errors }) %>

      <form class="form-grid" method="post" action="/register">
        <div class="grid-2">
          <label class="field">
            <span>Nome</span>
            <input type="text" name="first_name" value="<%= values.first_name || '' %>" autocomplete="given-name" required />
            <%- include('partials/field-errors', { errors, field: 'first_name' }) %>
          </label>

          <label class="field">
            <span>Sobrenome</span>
            <input type="text" name="last_name" value="<%= values.last_name || '' %>" autocomplete="family-name" required />
            <%- include('partials/field-errors', { errors, field: 'last_name' }) %>
          </label>
        </div>

        <label class="field">
          <span>Email</span>
          <input type="email" name="email" value="<%= values.email || '' %>" autocomplete="email" required />
          <%- include('partials/field-errors', { errors, field: 'email' }) %>
        </label>

        <label class="field">
          <span>Senha</span>
          <input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="6" />
          <small class="field-help">Minimo de 6 caracteres, com maiuscula, minuscula, numero e simbolo.</small>
          <%- include('partials/field-errors', { errors, field: 'password' }) %>
        </label>

        <button class="btn btn--primary btn--block" type="submit">Criar conta</button>
      </form>

      <p class="help">Ja tem cadastro? <a href="/login">Entrar agora</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>